// RUN: toyc -Z help | filecheck %s

// `-Z help` lists the unstable options, those of the driver first and then those of each stage
// under its own heading, and exits.

// CHECK:      Unstable options (-Z NAME[=VALUE]):
// CHECK:      driver
// CHECK:        pass-pipeline=PIPELINE
// CHECK:        dump-pass-pipeline
// CHECK:      stackvm backend
// CHECK-NEXT:   stackvm-keep-subtractions
